OL,3,AEd Davey calls for immediate 10p cut to
OL,4,Afuel duty
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Ed Davey is calling on the
OL,7,Fgovernment to immediately cut fuel duty
OL,8,Fby 10p a litre until Christmas as part
OL,9,Fof a package of policies aimed at
OL,10,Fcutting the cost of living.
OL,12,FThe Liberal Democrat leader is also
OL,13,Furging the government to scrap a
OL,14,Fpermanent increase in fuel duty which
OL,15,Fis set to take effect in January.
OL,17,FFuel duty was frozen under the
OL,18,FConservatives in March 2022 and Sir
OL,19,FKeir Starmer's government continued the
OL,20,Ffreeze, deciding in May to push back a
OL,21,Fplanned 3p increase in September until
OL,22,Fthe end of this year.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
